# Local dependency/build artifacts — never shadow pnpm/cargo state inside images
**/node_modules
**/.pnpm-store
**/target
**/dist
**/build
**/.svelte-kit
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/coverage

# Environment / secrets
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# VCS / IDE / OS noise
.git
.gitignore
.vscode
.idea
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db

# Dev-only artifacts
docker/volumes
**/tmp
